xml </p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 1500
move 690 490
sync 600
shot deep_k_open
click 300 175
sync 600
key 4D
sync 600
key 1b
sync 600
shot deep_k_typed
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show anon
keep kernel
stkuse
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 1
