logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs
wait 1500
move 690 490
wait 300
shot deep_p_open
logmark
click 300 175
expectsince document: drew
logmark
key 4D
expectsince document: drew
logmark
key 1b
expectsince document: key to screen
shot deep_p_typed
logmark
key 16 01
